   "stem_html": "A survey of students in a math class asked for the respondents’ birth months. The table below lists the responses:\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Dec</td>\n<td>Feb</td>\n<td>Apr</td>\n<td>Sep</td>\n<td>Nov</td>\n<td>Dec</td>\n<td>Aug</td>\n<td>Feb</td>\n<td>Feb</td>\n<td>Sep</td>\n<td>Oct</td>\n<td>Feb</td>\n<td>Jun</td>\n<td>Jan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jul</td>\n<td>May</td>\n<td>May</td>\n<td>Jan</td>\n<td>Mar</td>\n<td>Feb</td>\n<td>Nov</td>\n<td>Oct</td>\n<td>Apr</td>\n<td>Oct</td>\n<td>Aug</td>\n<td>Jan</td>\n<td>May</td>\n<td>Jan</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Give the categorical frequency distribution of the birth months.</p>\n",
